{
  "captions": [
    "Most recommendation engines are a model guessing.",
    "Post your catalogue and the shopper's context.",
    "Cloudy pool after heavy rain. What should we show?",
    "Ranked by real cosine similarity, scores included.",
    "It tells you what it is not: similarity, not intent.",
    "Vela Recs \u2014 $0.10 a recommendation."
  ],
  "scenes": [
    {
      "dur": 6.0,
      "comment": "hook",
      "html": "        <div class=\"eyebrow s1a\">Vela Recs \u00b7 recommendation ranking</div>\n        <div class=\"headline s1b\" style=\"margin-top:26px;\">Most recommendation engines<br />are a model <span class=\"teal\">guessing.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sub s1c\" style=\"margin-top:26px;\">This one is measured \u2014 and it shows you the number.</div>",
      "anim": [
        "enter('.s1a', T + 0.25, {y:20})",
        "tl.from('.s1b', {opacity:0, y:56, duration:0.85, ease:EXPO}, T + 0.5)",
        "enter('.s1c', T + 1.0)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dur": 5.5,
      "comment": "the call",
      "html": "        <div class=\"eyebrow s2a\">One call</div>\n        <div class=\"headline s2b\" style=\"font-size:56px;margin-top:20px;\">Up to fifty items,<br />plus the <span class=\"teal\">shopper's context.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"req s2c\">\n          <div><span class=\"m\">POST</span> <span class=\"u\">/api/xrpl/vela-recs-ranking</span></div>\n          <div><span class=\"c\">{ \"items\": [ \u2026 ], \"context\": </span><span class=\"u\">\"cloudy after heavy rain\"</span><span class=\"c\"> }</span></div>\n        </div>",
      "anim": [
        "enter('.s2a', T + 0.15, {y:18})",
        "enter('.s2b', T + 0.4)",
        "tl.from('.s2c', {opacity:0, scale:0.94, duration:0.7, ease:'back.out(1.4)'}, T + 1.1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dur": 7.0,
      "comment": "the context",
      "html": "        <div class=\"eyebrow s3a\">The shopper</div>\n        <div class=\"headline s3b\" style=\"font-size:50px;margin-top:18px;line-height:1.2;\">\"Pool water turned cloudy after heavy rain.<br />I want it clear <span class=\"teal\">before the weekend.</span>\"</div>\n        <div class=\"sub s3c\" style=\"font-size:26px;margin-top:28px;\">Six products in the catalogue. Which three go in front of them?</div>",
      "anim": [
        "enter('.s3a', T + 0.15, {y:18})",
        "enter('.s3b', T + 0.4)",
        "enter('.s3c', T + 2.6, {y:20})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dur": 11.0,
      "comment": "ranked result",
      "html": "        <div class=\"eyebrow s4a\">Ranked \u00b7 @cf/baai/bge-base-en-v1.5</div>\n        <div class=\"report\">\n          <div class=\"rrow s4b\"><div class=\"mark ok\">1</div><div class=\"nm\">Pool Clarifier 1L</div><div class=\"val\">0.6998</div></div>\n          <div class=\"rrow s4c\"><div class=\"mark ok\">2</div><div class=\"nm\">Cartridge filter element</div><div class=\"val\">0.5564</div></div>\n          <div class=\"rrow s4d\"><div class=\"mark ok\">3</div><div class=\"nm\">Telescopic leaf net</div><div class=\"val\">0.5352</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sub s4e\" style=\"font-size:26px;margin-top:34px;\">Real cosine similarity on real embeddings \u2014 not a model's opinion.</div>",
      "anim": [
        "enter('.s4a', T + 0.15, {y:18})",
        "tl.from('.s4b', {opacity:0, x:-50, duration:0.55, ease:EXPO}, T + 1.4)",
        "tl.from('.s4c', {opacity:0, x:-50, duration:0.55, ease:EXPO}, T + 3.1)",
        "tl.from('.s4d', {opacity:0, x:-50, duration:0.55, ease:EXPO}, T + 4.8)",
        "enter('.s4e', T + 6.6, {y:20})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dur": 6.0,
      "comment": "honest scope",
      "html": "        <div class=\"eyebrow s5a\">And it tells you what it is not</div>\n        <div class=\"headline s5b\" style=\"font-size:48px;margin-top:18px;line-height:1.25;\">Semantic similarity \u2014<br /><span class=\"teal\">not purchase-intent data.</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sub s5c\" style=\"font-size:26px;margin-top:30px;\">The methodology ships in the response, so nobody has to guess how the order was reached.</div>",
      "anim": [
        "tl.from('.s5a', {opacity:0, scale:1.05, filter:'blur(8px)', duration:0.55, ease:EXPO}, T + 0.1)",
        "enter('.s5b', T + 0.45)",
        "enter('.s5c', T + 3.0, {y:20})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dur": 5.0,
      "comment": "close",
      "html": "        <div class=\"outro-glow s6glow\"></div>\n        <div class=\"tile s6tile\">ED</div>\n        <div class=\"wordmark s6a\"><span class=\"shimmer-sweep-target\">Vela <span class=\"teal\">Recs</span></span></div>\n        <div class=\"sub s6b\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\">Ranking you can audit. $0.10 a recommendation.</div>\n        <div class=\"url-pill s6c\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>vela.emergedigital.com</div>",
      "anim": [
        "tl.fromTo('.s6glow', {opacity:0, scale:0.6}, {opacity:1, scale:1, duration:1.0, ease:'power2.out'}, T + 0.1)",
        "tl.from('.s6tile', {opacity:0, scale:0.7, rotate:-8, duration:0.6, ease:'back.out(1.7)'}, T + 0.2)",
        "enter('.s6a', T + 0.5, {scale:0.96, y:0})",
        "shimmer('.s6a .shimmer-sweep-target', T + 1.0)",
        "enter('.s6b', T + 1.0, {y:20})",
        "tl.from('.s6c', {opacity:0, y:16, duration:0.6, ease:EXPO}, T + 1.6)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}